The plugin targets the DSH web profile. It was checked against the local Deepseek Harness client build metadata `0.2.2-alpha.3`; this identifies the local repository/build metadata and does not independently verify a separately installed application binary.

@mykeura/dsh-minimalist-themes README · pin a version:：pnpm dsh plugin --profile web add github:mykeura/dsh-minimalist-themes#v1.1.1
```

Once the plugin is installed, open **Plugins** from the main screen and select **DSH Minimalist Themes** to access its theme picker.
